":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build beautiful and cute cities in this game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about complex resource tables and endless citizen needs. This game will transport you to the atmosphere of a cozy <strong>board game,</strong> where the rules are easy to learn but hard to master. There's no room for stress here\u2014only the relaxing process of building your ideal, charming town. Increase your profit, complete quests, and watch your masterpiece come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.poster.avif?t=1760900239\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.webm?t=1760900239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.mp4?t=1760900239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building at your disposal is unique! They interact with each other, working in a powerful synergy. Place fields next to each other, and fishermen's houses in a quiet spot, and see how they generate more income. Experiment with placement to unlock your city's maximum potential!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new game - a new challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a unique challenge! You will need to complete <strong>2 random quests</strong> to win, but be careful: one limitation will keep you on your toes. This system provides endless replayability\u2014you never know what combination of trials lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/dad2fae490c47b3d28d4e5b1e029ab1e.avif?t=1760900239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras_big/dad2fae490c47b3d28d4e5b1e029ab1e.avif?t=1760900239 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of dangers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in many board games, there is an element of surprise! Your small town might face unforeseen events. The formidable forces of nature (tornadoes, tsunamis) or problems caused by people (fires, crises) will threaten your creation. Will you be able to prepare for the twists of fate and protect your city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/acafc31ba7743012f177d167eeeb582f.poster.avif?t=1760900239\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/acafc31ba7743012f177d167eeeb582f.webm?t=1760900239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/acafc31ba7743012f177d167eeeb582f.mp4?t=1760900239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to create without limits? The &quot;Sandbox&quot; mode is your own gaming table where you set the rules! Here, there are no quests, limitations, or sudden disasters (unless you want them). Simply choose buildings and build your dream city however your heart desires.</p>","developers":["JDF GAMES"],"genres":[{"descriptio